### 担当者情報
POST http://localhost:51603/mcp
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json;charset=utf-8
Mcp-Session-Id: 945e20bf-4c42-4544-a017-3a84299b131e
Authorization: SuperUer:SYS

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 4,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "mcp_meetingservice_GetCustomerContacts",
    "arguments": {
      "custid": "C001"
    }
  }
}

### 取引先会社のID（customer_id）から取引先顧客会社情報を取得
###（CRMにある情報のイメージ）
POST http://localhost:51603/mcp
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json;charset=utf-8
Mcp-Session-Id: 945e20bf-4c42-4544-a017-3a84299b131e
Authorization: SuperUer:SYS

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 4,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "mcp_meetingservice_GetCustomerInfo",
    "arguments": {
      "custid": "C001"
    }
  }
}
